{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影の合間に小道具で\n伊織と遊んでたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/12/1101174/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/12/1101174/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃん んーにゃ の日。\n2   / 1    2 。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫の日だね！\n(今作ったけど...)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この鼻を上手く着けるのが\n物凄く難しくて\n手で持つという苦肉の策に..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下の写真は鼻+鼻になっちゃってるもんね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#chihaOOTD"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のお気に入りのネックレス。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばあちゃんが旅行行った時に\nお土産で買ってきてくれたの！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/12/1101174/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガムランボールと言って、\nシャリーンと音が鳴るんだよ◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガムランボールは、着けているだけで\n願い事が叶うって言われているの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事な仕事の時には着けて行ってる！\n願掛けの意味も込めて☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私と同じでおばあちゃんも叔母もお母さんも\nアクセサリーが大好きで\nおさがりをよくくれるんだ( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年はたっくさんのイヤリングを\n私におばあちゃんがくれた。\nどれも大ぶりで可愛くて私の好み♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はね、叔母が昔使ってた\nチョーカーにもなる短いネックレスをくれたの！\n私がチョーカー好きなのを知ってて...\n嬉しかった〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「笑えれば」ウルフルズさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲は本当に誰もが元気をもらえる\n素敵な曲だと思う。\n歌詞に本当に勇気付けられる。\n悲しい時、辛い時に聞きたくなるし\n聞いて欲しい。\n\"とにかく笑えれば 最後に笑えれば\n答えのない毎日に ハハハと笑えれば\"\n辛い時こそ笑顔でいられたら。\n無理してでも笑顔を作ると\n脳は楽しいと錯覚するんだって。\n辛い時こそ笑顔が大切なのかもね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/12/1101174/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛の変顔可愛いヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちなみにね、上の猫の飼い主は\n伊織なんだよ〜(´>∀<｀)ゝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ、伊織が飼い主ね！って\n言ってくれたの。\nなかよし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}